{
  "title": "AppTown",
  "uid": "forge-telemetry",
  "tags": [
    "forge"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "label": "instance",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(forge_http_request_duration_milliseconds_count, job)",
          "refId": "vinstance"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "model",
        "label": "model",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(forge_inference_tokens_total, model)",
          "refId": "vmodel"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "step_type",
        "label": "step type",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(forge_step_attempts_total, step_type)",
          "refId": "vstep_type"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "route",
        "label": "route",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(forge_http_request_duration_milliseconds_count, http_route)",
          "refId": "vroute"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "run",
        "label": "run",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "tempo_url",
        "label": "Grafana URL for trace links (empty: this Grafana)",
        "description": "The address of the Grafana whose Explore view has the Tempo data source, e.g. https://grafana.example.com. Leave empty when this dashboard runs in that Grafana.",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Inference \u2014 usage, not cost. Cache reads are part of input, so they are shown apart.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Tokens in and out, by model",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (model, direction) (increase(forge_inference_tokens_total{job=~\"$instance\", model=~\"$model\", direction=~\"input|output\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} {{direction}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "Tokens the provider billed as input and output. Cache reads are counted inside input by providers and are shown in the panel beside this one.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Cache reads and writes, by model",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (model, direction) (increase(forge_inference_tokens_total{job=~\"$instance\", model=~\"$model\", direction=~\"cache_read|cache_write\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} {{direction}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "How much of the input was served from the provider's cache. Not additive with the panel to the left.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Inference requests by provider and outcome",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (provider, outcome) (increase(forge_inference_requests_total{job=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} {{outcome}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "Anything other than complete is a request the model did not finish.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Inference latency p50 / p95 by model",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le, model) (rate(forge_inference_request_duration_milliseconds_bucket{job=~\"$instance\", model=~\"$model\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} p50",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, model) (rate(forge_inference_request_duration_milliseconds_bucket{job=~\"$instance\", model=~\"$model\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} p95",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "Gateway request duration from admission to completion.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Steps \u2014 how long attempts run, how they end, and whether they waited",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Step running time by step type",
      "type": "heatmap",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (le) (increase(forge_step_duration_milliseconds_bucket{job=~\"$instance\", step_type=~\"$step_type\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "format": "heatmap",
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "Only attempts whose harness ran have a duration; the outcome chart beside this counts every attempt. One run's review loop is a Tempo question, not a heat-map one: use the run link below.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "yAxis": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "color": {
          "mode": "scheme",
          "scheme": "Oranges",
          "steps": 32
        },
        "cellGap": 1,
        "legend": {
          "show": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "yHistogram": true
        },
        "exemplars": {
          "color": "rgba(255,0,255,0.7)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Attempt outcomes by step type",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (step_type, outcome) (increase(forge_step_attempts_total{job=~\"$instance\", step_type=~\"$step_type\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{step_type}} {{outcome}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "Every settled attempt, including ones that never ran a harness. rework is the reviewer sending it round again. settlement_error and abandoned should be zero; when they are not, look at the run.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "valueMode": "color",
        "namePlacement": "top"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Queue wait p95 by step type",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, step_type) (rate(forge_step_queued_milliseconds_bucket{job=~\"$instance\", step_type=~\"$step_type\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{step_type}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "Time an attempt waited for a model slot. Flat zero means slots are not the constraint. Buckets start at zero so a zero wait reads as zero.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "API \u2014 what the pages and the CLI wait on",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Requests per second by route",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 34,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (http_route) (rate(forge_http_request_duration_milliseconds_count{job=~\"$instance\", http_route=~\"$route\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Error rate (5xx) by route",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 34,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (http_route) (rate(forge_http_request_duration_milliseconds_count{job=~\"$instance\", status=\"5xx\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "Server errors only. Empty is good; a series here names the route to open.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "p95 latency by route (the agent's check call excluded)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 42,
        "w": 18,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, http_route) (rate(forge_http_request_duration_milliseconds_bucket{job=~\"$instance\", http_route=~\"$route\", http_route!=\"POST /api/v1/changes/{id}/check\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "The agent's check call runs the project's tests inside one request and takes tens of seconds by design; on this axis it would bury every page. It has its own stat to the right.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "max"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "title": "Agent check call p95",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 42,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(forge_http_request_duration_milliseconds_bucket{job=~\"$instance\", http_route=\"POST /api/v1/changes/{id}/check\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "POST /api/v1/changes/{id}/check: the project's tests run inside this request. A job wearing an HTTP request's clothes.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Jobs \u2014 background work by operation, from the job spans",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 50,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "title": "Job executions per minute by operation",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 51,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"forged\" && name=~\"job.*\"} | rate() by (span.forge.job.operation)",
          "refId": "A",
          "limit": 20
        }
      ],
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "title": "Job duration p95 by operation",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 51,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"forged\" && name=~\"job.*\"} | quantile_over_time(duration, .95) by (span.forge.job.operation)",
          "refId": "A",
          "limit": 20
        }
      ],
      "description": "A completion job that starts taking seconds is worth a look.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "title": "Follow a run",
      "type": "text",
      "datasource": null,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 59,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [],
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Every step and inference span carries the run id. Type one into the **run** box at the top, then open the traces for it:\n\n[Tempo: traces for run $run](${tempo_url}/explore?schemaVersion=1&panes=%7B%22f%22%3A%7B%22datasource%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B%7B%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22tempo%22%7D%2C%22queryType%22%3A%22traceql%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22%7Bresource.service.name%3D%5C%22forged%5C%22%20%26%26%20span.forge.run%3D$run%7D%22%7D%5D%2C%22range%22%3A%7B%22from%22%3A%22${__from}%22%2C%22to%22%3A%22${__to}%22%7D%7D%7D)\n\nEach `workflow.step` trace has a `queued` and a `running` child; each `inference.request` span links to the step attempt that made it."
      }
    }
  ]
}